    12	- **6.1 first (non-negotiable foundation), then 6.4 immediately, before full 6.2 / 6.3 / 6.5 / 6.6.** Python UDFs are the strategic wedge ("Python-signal → pokeable-sheet") on the canonical **Month-6 Python kill gate** (debug-from-cell, `BoundFrame`, `qb.show(df)`). Engine 6 = Product Phases 5/6/7/8 = v1-critical; Engine 5 collab = Product Phase 9 = v1.5-deferred.
