   109	    6.3 follow-up.
   110	  - **✅ IDE consumer wiring realized (cross-repo, 2026-05-28, IDE `feat/visualise-v1` `c24222315ed`):**
   111	    the VS Code fork now consumes the `Session` class through its real Node load path —
   112	    `extensions/quantlab/src/quantbook/{types.ts,loader.ts,session.ts}` (typed `SessionInstance`, a
   113	    `Session` fail-at-boundary shape-check in `loadQuantbookEngine()`, a `createWorkbookSession()`
