   730	
   731	## 11. Per-binding obligations
   732	
   733	All bindings are adapters over the same `EngineSession` trait + DTOs; the existing `ql-bindings-node`
   734	becomes an adapter in 6.3.
   735	
   736	| Binding | Handle | Async | Error mapping | Release |
   737	|---------|--------|-------|---------------|---------|
   738	| **Node** | `#[napi]` / `Arc<Mutex<WorkbookSession>>` | `async`⇒`Promise`; long ops via op-id | `EngineError`→JS `Error` w/ `.code`/`.class`/`.details` (replaces `[kind]` parse) | GC |
   739	| **Python** (`quantbook-py`) | PyO3 class, GIL-aware | `asyncio` await | → typed exception hierarchy keyed on `class` | GC |
