   741	| **WASM** | JS handle | Promise | `EngineError`→JS object | JS GC |
   742	| **Service** (6.2) | session-per-connection | streaming (SSE/gRPC); op-id cancel over the wire | →HTTP problem+json / gRPC status+details | connection close |
