  2364	        // caller requested extras we do not yet serve, fail loud rather than
  2365	        // silently returning a narrower result than asked for. Empty cells are
  2366	        // `CellValue::Blank` (added inc.2c) so the columnar shape stays
  2367	        // fixed-size.
