   756	    /// write helper. The three blocked-spill arms in `write_spill`
   757	    /// (degenerate → `#CALC!`, bounds → `#SPILL!`, blocking →
   758	    /// `#SPILL!`) all do the same five lines: clear user, write error
   759	    /// to computed, persist formula text, return `(err, None)`.
   760	    /// Factor into one helper so a future fix can't update one arm
