   250	/// Cells past a failure point keep their pre-recompute (potentially stale)
   251	/// values; their formula text is preserved either way (recompute never
   252	/// clears formula on failure). Iteration order is `HashMap`-arbitrary
   253	/// today (GAP-R-01); Engine Phase 3 calcgraph integration makes it
   254	/// topological.
   255	///
