   259	/// — VEQ-3-03's "profile records skipped downstream vertices." A dirty
   260	/// formula whose direct cell deps all stayed at their prior values, and
   261	/// which has no range deps or volatile flag, is skipped entirely during
   262	/// `recompute_dirty`. The counter is `0` for `recompute_all` (which
   263	/// always processes every formula in HashMap order — no VEQ logic).
   264	///
   265	/// Phase 3.9 (W5-42, 2026-05-12) adds `simd_classified` — SIMD-3-03's
   266	/// "graph profile shows region execution." Counts how many of the dirty
   267	/// formulas had plans that `lower::classify` says are SIMD-eligible
   268	/// (`SimdShape != NotApplicable`). V1 of Phase 3.9 doesn't yet batch
   269	/// these into bulk Arrow kernel calls (that's the Phase 4.7+ array-
