quantbook-engine/docs/architecture/2026-05-16-phase-4.10-function-library-wave-2.md:171:`values_match_for_switch`: case-insensitive String equality, Number bitwise-equal (NaN never matches NaN), Bool exact, Blank == Blank. **Number↔String cross-type never matches** (type-strict per Excel canon).
quantbook-engine/docs/architecture/2026-05-16-phase-4.10-function-library-wave-2.md:228:  - `N(v)` — coerce to number: Number→same, Bool→0/1, Date→serial (existing date_system), String/Error→0, Blank→0.
