quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-19-phase-5-2-d-1-step-1-codex.md:1175:quantbook-engine/crates/ql-functions/tests/coverage.rs:409:        "W5-D-11; unit tests pin Microsoft example (k=0.3 on {1..4} → 1.9), k=0 → min, k=1 → max, k=0.5 on odd count → median, unsorted-input parity, single-element early return, k<0 and k>1 → #NUM!, NaN k → #NUM! (panic-safety; W5-D-11.1 closure), empty → #NUM! (via all-Blank range), text in range → #VALUE! (engine-wide W5-58 strict convention; diverges from Microsoft skip-text canon), Blank in range skipped, error/text k propagation, Boolean k coerces TRUE→1/FALSE→0, arity.",
