quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-18-phase-4-11-architecture-codex.md:265:- IronCalc `xlsx/src/import/` is a full roll-own OOXML importer, including workbook rels, styles, tables, worksheets, shared formulas, dynamic array metadata, and comments. Its exporter expects the model to be evaluated before saving formula values. This is effective because IronCalc's model is much more OOXML-shaped than Quantbook's.
