quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-18-phase-4-12-megaudit-opus-b.md:202:- No PANICs across 10 op-log defensive probes — `OpLog::import_bytes` of random / truncated / byte-flipped / zero-length / 16 MiB-zero inputs all return typed `OpLogError::Loro(DecodeError(...))`. `replay_into` with `u32::MAX` coords or nonexistent sheet returns typed `ReplayError`. Out-of-bounds format-id surfaces `ReplayError::FormatNotRegistered`.
