quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-29-6-4-3d-audit/SYNTHESIS.md:31:  TEXT only, so the cell holds no computed value; preserve read `Blank` and wrote it back. Opus-engine
quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-12-megaudit.md:26:| Stale sheet id → silent `Value::Blank` (should be `#REF!`) | ✓ | ✓ |   |   |   |   |
quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-12-megaudit.md:45:Phase 2A.6 audit L4 added `validate_sheet` but missed row/col bounds. `rt.set_formula(0, MAX_ROW+1, 0, "1+1")` runs lex/parse/bind/eval to completion, then panics at `put_at` → `Sheet::put`. In transactions, the panic happens mid-commit leaving a partial-write state. Three agents flagged this independently.
quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-12-megaudit.md:47:**Fix**: extend `validate_sheet` to `validate_cell(workbook, sheet, row, col)` checking both bounds; add `RuntimeError::InvalidCell { sheet, row, col }`. Wire into all four entry points. ~30 min.
quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-12-megaudit.md:84:### H6 — Stale sheet id (saved formula refs deleted sheet) silently reads `Value::Blank` instead of `#REF!` ✅ CLOSED 2A.7
quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-12-megaudit.md:87:A formula authored against `Sheet3!A1` in a workbook now with 2 sheets binds to `ExprPlan::CellRef { sheet: 2, ... }`, which `WorkbookEnv::read_cell` maps to `Value::Blank`. The env.rs comment admits this is a deferred semantic ("Phase 3+ FormulaRegion binder"). Two agents flagged it. The same agents flagged that `Phase 2A.6` already established the pattern (`NamedTargetIsBlank`, `NamedTargetIsError`) for surfacing previously-silent paths.
quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-12-megaudit.md:110:**Fix**: extend `pub use plan::{...}` to include `bind_with_names, NameLookup, ResolvedName, NamedTargetIsBlank, NamedTargetIsError`. ~1 min.
quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-12-megaudit.md:133:- **M2** ✅ CLOSED 2A.9 — new `compare_values_excel` with Number < Text < Bool type ordering for cross-type compare; Blank coerces to 0 / "" per peer; same-type pairs unchanged.
quantbook-engine/docs/audits/2026-05-12-megaudit.md:148:- **M11** ✅ CLOSED 2A.8 — `CellWireValue::Pending` variant added. Formula+Blank cells serialize as Pending (was #NULL! sentinel); v1 legacy #NULL!+formula auto-rewrites to Pending on load.
